  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Style reference = retrieval over your whole catalogue",
      "items": [
        "Every Lightroom RAW+XMP pair becomes an exemplar: 14-d EXIF/histogram features, the 12 settings you moved, curve and colour habits",
        "Optional 768-d SigLIP 2 image embedding; hybrid distance sum w(q-e)^2 + W_EMB(1-cos), W_EMB = 2.0 from a 147-exemplar scan",
        "The 4 nearest past edits reach the advisor as a soft reference; blend cap 0.6, never a copy; the rationale names them"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Reverse-fit: inverse rendering with an honesty budget",
      "items": [
        "Luminance CDFs matched at the engine tone knots, least-squares on the slider basis with a model-selection prior; foreign-hue veto >= 45 deg / 5%",
        "Structural divergence D picks Full or bounded Atmosphere (EV +-1, WB gain 0.80-1.25, sat +-30, slope 0.5-1.5, confidence <= 0.50)",
        "DIFT (SD 2.1) correspondence: 48x48 field, confidence = cyclic consistency x flow smoothness, consulted only when D >= 0.35"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Local corrections, gated on frozen evidence",
      "items": [
        "Semantic sky/land zones or XMP-native luminance bands from rank-paired residuals; verdicts follow the population a correction moves",
        "Quadtree tiles: strongest nodes first, 4x4 stop, both frames >= 3% evidence, CI excludes zero, cross-boundary step <= 0.012, zero-tolerance frame law",
        "12x8x8 bilateral-grid analyzer prices the ceiling first (calibration pair: global 0.0961, ceiling 0.0700) and halves the tile budget when the remainder is not tile-shaped",
        "Designed next: free-form remainder masks, multi-region semantic calibration, colour-range regions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Measured, local, quarantined",
      "items": [
        "Lightroom parity by measurement: Texture 45/45 anchors within 0.02, radial 41/41 vectors within 1 px, brush D1 874 -> 9.8 px; linear openly not pixel-closed",
        "Local models licence-screened and sha256/byte-pinned: BiRefNet, OneFormer ADE20K, SAM 2.1, SigLIP 2, SD 2.1 as DIFT featurizer, SCUNet",
        "Generated pixels (gpt-image-2 reimagine via the Images API, heal, denoise) live on their own cards and are measured with the same D before any fit"
      ]
    }
  ]
